Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 02:46:16 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 189/230] design(space): vertical spacing scale
 (xs/sm/md/lg/xl/2xl) applied to feed, profile, match detail
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

--space-xs..2xl tokens map to named --spacing-* utilities in index.css. The
three rhythm-critical pages (Matches, Profile, MatchDetail) now use mt-md/lg/
xl instead of ad-hoc 12/16/24px: Matches group headers break at mt-lg, Profile
sections breathe at mt-xl with space-y-sm list gaps, MatchDetail headers to
content sit at mt-md. Tight in-card gaps (mt-1/mt-2) are intentional exceptions.

🤖 Generated with Codebuff
Co-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
